  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $f o g(-x)=f[g(-x)]=f[-g(x)]$ $(\\because g$ is odd $)$\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=\\mathrm{f}[\\mathrm{g}(\\mathrm{x})] \\quad(\\because \\mathrm{fis} \\text { even }) \\\\\r\n=\\operatorname{fog}(\\mathrm{x}) \\forall \\mathrm{x} \\in \\mathrm{R}\r\n\\end{array}$\r\n$\\therefore$ fog is an even function.",
